One-time implementation reference
=================================

Repository: https://github.com/junwoojeong100/microsoft-foundry-labs-v1.5
Inspected commit: eda75fa7f8a8d3548d21c919d5c0b836c7d818e4

The ownership ledger, immutable runtime-contract, explicit approval, calibration,
and opt-in OIDC patterns informed this implementation. The implementation,
purchasing policies, tests, and execution evidence are maintained in this
repository. No installation, execution, build, test, packaging, or CI step
requires access to the reference repository. Its travel-policy data and past
validation results are not included as Contoso data or evidence.

